{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aDoveDays : Time Flies\u300b is a compact and addictive casual puzzle game. It combines many classic games with some stress-relieving mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles are designed to be intuitive, with multiple solutions available.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is perfect for gamers who enjoy a relaxed gaming experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can skip levels at will.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hints are available at any time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where should the tools be placed? How to solve the problem of non-adjacent colors? How should the blocks be arranged!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I need to eliminate the red dot on my phone! It's so annoying!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the game to enjoy a peaceful world, a relaxing puzzle game that's easy on the mind, and some challenging puzzles waiting for you to experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDoveDays : Time Flies\u201d features countless levels for you to discover, ensuring stress relief all the way through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850610/extras/bbc38349006a286ea624cbedd1e596a7.poster.avif?t=1769063365\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850610/extras/bbc38349006a286ea624cbedd1e596a7.webm?t=1769063365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850610/extras/bbc38349006a286ea624cbedd1e596a7.mp4?t=1769063365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850610/extras/fe894a9435cb1239381b85ab9d5e6c0e.poster.avif?t=1769063365\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850610/extras/fe894a9435cb1239381b85ab9d5e6c0e.webm?t=1769063365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850610/extras/fe894a9435cb1239381b85ab9d5e6c0e.mp4?t=1769063365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to play a specific series of games? Want to keep playing a relaxing game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDoveDays : Time Flies\u201d offers a casual mode, allowing you to play various similar levels and relaxing levels. It's pure bliss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850610/extras/45e3a6208b510cfc5e1fa255070086a7.poster.avif?t=1769063365\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850610/extras/45e3a6208b510cfc5e1fa255070086a7.webm?t=1769063365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850610/extras/45e3a6208b510cfc5e1fa255070086a7.mp4?t=1769063365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We hope it brings you joy and relaxation!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Addictive short level design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Diverse casual puzzle gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Average of a few minutes per level, perfect for utilizing spare time to unwind and refresh your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd2f Smooth difficulty curve, easy to pick up, gradually getting better, with a sense of accomplishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Cute art style and soothing color palette create a relaxed puzzle-solving atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u269c\ufe0f You can skip levels at any time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 Addictive sound effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"So be it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850610/a1892d401faa5e21804828e83ecceb1a62daa6e7.jpg"},{"name":"A deep card","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850610/60204b76c0846c8185333327edc8e96cc8173c6b.jpg"},{"name":"Easy like","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850610/8145136d9a2031f8f38453b3fe3270957be9bbf1.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850610/564d35855c67bacc00e46bc35d00bb965e1001f2.jpg"},{"name":"Arithmetic expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850610/dc9e41b4e36eb63e5d7a9b85115368232b5f20e5.jpg"},{"name":"Mine clearance expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850610/66b6171dfed880a9b9433ec6d7dcec69f508261b.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Medal Catcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850610/fcb2d65